  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&label=Discord&style=plastic&logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>村民牽引線<br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">此模組允許您使用牽引線跟蹤村民和遊蕩商人，方法是覆蓋 AbstractVillager 類別。 canBeLeash 方法傳回 true，這使您可以將牽引線附著在村民身上，並將他們移動到您想要的任何地方。</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>v2.1.0：設定檔與更多</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>更新：新增設定檔案，您可以選擇哪些生物可以被牽引，0 = false，1 = true</li>\n<li>新增：蝙蝠、烏龜和喪屍村民的可選牽引線，使用設定檔案以啟用它們的牽引功能<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/240/villagerleadsconfig-png.png\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>取得模組套件許可：</strong></span><br>您可以使用此模組或我的任何模組來建立您的模組套件。<br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8-DA_JOVOaQ?t=13s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/976/banner_hammers.png\"></a></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bark-carpets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/953/banner_barkcarpets.png\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-awnings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/952/banner_awnings.png\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/982/banner_bone.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/395/14/obsidian_equipment.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-snorkel-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/396/811/banner_snorkel.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/exline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/73838725-ba9a-49e1-83b8-c87b658405cb.webp\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">您有興趣支持我和我模組的發展嗎？如果是，我建議您嘗試使用 BisectHosting。作為新客戶，使用代碼：EXLINE，即可在第一個月的遊戲伺服器獲得 25% 折扣。憑藉全天候支援和快速響應時間，您可以期待出色的遊戲需求服務。</p>",
